### 🚀 About Me

- 📱 **Mobile Software Engineer** building production iOS & Android apps  
- 🚕 Working on **Cab Yetu** — ride‑hailing platform with **10K+ monthly users**  
- 🧺 Founder & mobile engineer at **Fua Chap Chap** — offline‑first laundry platform  
- ⚡ Love **real‑time systems**, **payments**, and **performance optimization**

---

### 🧰 Tech Stack

**Mobile**

- Swift · Objective‑C · Kotlin · Flutter · React Native  
- UIKit · Core Data · Core Location · Android SDK · MVVM · MVC

**Backend & Realtime**

- REST APIs · WebSockets · Firebase (FCM, Realtime DB) · JWT · Session management  
- Push notifications · Real‑time tracking · Tencent IM

**Tooling & Infra**

- Git · CI/CD · Fastlane · Multi‑env configs · Staged rollouts  
- M‑Pesa STK Push · Wallet systems · Payment verification

